Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.29,0:01:54.25,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.05,0:01:59.42,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.64,0:01:59.05,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.68,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
