Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.91,0:02:04.71,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.93,0:02:09.02,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.05,0:02:08.37,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:09.02,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.42,0:02:10.26,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.31,0:02:14.78,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.11,0:02:18.20,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:20.08,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
