Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:41.63,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,努力~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.79,0:22:42.71,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转换好心情~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.71,0:22:43.67,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Ei~Ei~Oh！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.88,0:22:45.21,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
