Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.13,0:22:48.68,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Crash on！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.59,0:22:50.43,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,觉得惊讶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.51,0:22:52.01,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,心想「怎么搞的!?」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.22,0:22:55.10,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,就算从逆境开始也OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.10,0:22:55.56,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.56,0:22:57.43,OP＆ED,,100,0,20,,扭转乾坤吧 ！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:22:58.85,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,怀着！信！心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.02,0:23:02.69,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,打个哈欠 伸个懒腰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.90,0:23:05.61,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Let's Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.94,0:23:05.61,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,舒服多了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.94,0:23:07.69,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,忧虑也好 疲倦也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.86,0:23:09.32,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,能够让人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.32,0:23:10.95,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Fi~
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.20,0:23:12.99,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,ve~
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.53,0:23:11.11,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,重振精神的源泉是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.16,0:23:14.33,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One Two Three Four Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.28,0:23:13.87,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,Powerful smiling{\b1\fs65} ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.87,0:23:17.70,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！Go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:17.41,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,接着来跳努力平衡心情的舞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:21.21,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Precure5！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:20.96,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,借此把压力也 → 一扫而空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.79,0:23:24.75,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！Go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.96,0:23:24.34,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,大家都是闪耀的宝石
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.50,0:23:27.80,OP＆ED,,100,0,20,,闪烁着自己的生命之光～
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.38,0:23:30.18,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Oh~Yes~！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.18,0:23:31.80,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,追寻梦想的奇迹{\b1\fs65}☆
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.93,0:23:35.10,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,事事高升~
